  "description": "A lightweight, in-process event aggregator for .NET enabling loosely coupled publish/subscribe messaging between components. Configurable DI lifetime (scoped or singleton), synchronous and asynchronous handlers, deterministic disposal, AOT/trim-safe, and thread-safe under concurrent publish/subscribe. Works in Blazor, MAUI, WPF, ASP.NET Core, worker services, and console apps.",
